<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαίτιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτία</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blamed for</i> a thing, <i>blameable,
			blameworthy</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of
			persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ τί μοι ὔμμες ἐπαίτιοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.335
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>
			<i>for</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				465
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1383
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>accused of</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.61
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὰ ποιεῖν πρός τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Comp.Dion.Brut.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναχωρησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.65
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαιτιώτατοι τῶν κινδύνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					7.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαίτια, τά,</span>
			<i>legal punishments,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστιμήματα</span>
			, Solon ap.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.22
			</span></i>, Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.105
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
